{"seq":1,"slug":"image-audio-compression","title":"图像与音频有损压缩","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/data-compression-algorithms/specialized/image-audio-compression","wordCount":1574,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"图像与音频有损压缩\">图像与音频有损压缩</h1><p>通用压缩器面对一张照片几乎无能为力——像素值的串级重复很少，<a href=\"../dictionary/lz77-lz78-lzw\">LZ</a>和<a href=\"../entropy-coding/\">熵编码</a>榨不出多少油水。但 JPEG 能把同一张照片压到原始的十分之一仍然好看。这巨大的差距来自一个前提：图像和音频允许<a href=\"../foundations/lossless-vs-lossy\">有损</a>，而人类的眼睛和耳朵有大量感知盲区。媒体压缩的全部艺术，就是精准地丢掉人感知不到的那部分。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-感知冗余与变换编码\">核心概念：感知冗余与变换编码</h2><p>照片和录音里藏着一类通用压缩看不见的<a href=\"../foundations/entropy-redundancy\">冗余</a>：感知冗余。人眼对亮度敏感、对色度迟钝，对低频（大色块）敏感、对高频（细密纹理）迟钝；人耳听不见被强音掩蔽的弱音、听不到超出频率范围的成分。有损媒体编码的核心套路是变换编码：把信号变换到一个「感知重要性可分离」的域（频域），再激进地量化掉不重要的成分。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[原始图像/音频] --&gt; B[变换到频域&lt;br/&gt;DCT / 小波 / MDCT]&#10;    B --&gt; C[按感知模型量化&lt;br/&gt;丢弃不重要系数]&#10;    C --&gt; D[大量系数变 0]&#10;    D --&gt; E[RLE + 熵编码]&#10;    E --&gt; F[压缩文件]\">flowchart TD\n    A[原始图像/音频] --&gt; B[变换到频域&lt;br/&gt;DCT / 小波 / MDCT]\n    B --&gt; C[按感知模型量化&lt;br/&gt;丢弃不重要系数]\n    C --&gt; D[大量系数变 0]\n    D --&gt; E[RLE + 熵编码]\n    E --&gt; F[压缩文件]</pre><p>注意流水线的尾段又回到了我们熟悉的工具：量化后大量系数变成 0，由 <a href=\"../entropy-coding/run-length\">RLE</a> 和<a href=\"../entropy-coding/arithmetic-coding-ans\">霍夫曼/算术编码</a> 收尾。有损部分只在「量化」这一步发生，前后都是无损的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"jpeg-变换编码的经典范本\">JPEG：变换编码的经典范本</h2><p>JPEG 是理解整条流水线的最佳教材。它把图像切成 8×8 的块，对每块做离散余弦变换（DCT），把空间像素转成 64 个频率系数——左上角是直流（平均亮度），越往右下频率越高。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mn>7</mn></munderover><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mn>7</mn></munderover><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>u</mi><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>16</mn></mfrac><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>v</mi><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>16</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F(u,v)=\\frac{1}{4}C(u)C(v)\\sum_{x=0}^{7}\\sum_{y=0}^{7} f(x,y)\\cos\\frac{(2x+1)u\\pi}{16}\\cos\\frac{(2y+1)v\\pi}{16}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.2043em;vertical-align:-1.4032em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8011em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8829em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2671em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8011em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8829em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4032em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">cos</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">16</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">cos</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">16</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>接着是有损的关键一步：用量化表除每个系数并取整，高频系数对应的除数大，于是大量高频被归零。再加上色度子采样（如 4:2:0，把色度分辨率减半，利用人眼对颜色不敏感），JPEG 就实现了惊人的压缩。最后把量化系数按 Z 字形扫描排成一维、用<a href=\"../entropy-coding/run-length\">零游程加霍夫曼</a>编码。质量参数 Q 本质上就是在缩放量化表，直接对应<a href=\"../foundations/lossless-vs-lossy\">率失真曲线</a>上的取舍点。</p>\n<p>这套流程也解释了 JPEG 那些标志性的瑕疵从何而来：8×8 分块独立处理，在平滑渐变区会暴露出块与块之间的台阶（块效应）；高频被粗暴量化后，锐利边缘附近会泛起波纹状的振铃伪影。理解了伪影的成因，就能反过来指导用法——把质量调到合适档位、避开对锐利图形使用 JPEG，正是针对这些机制的对症下药。现代格式用更大的可变块、更好的环内滤波，正是为了缓解这些上一代算法的固有缺陷。</p>\n<h2 id=\"现代图像格式-avif-jpeg-xl-之争-2025-2026\">现代图像格式：AVIF、JPEG XL 之争（2025–2026）</h2><p>JPEG 三十年未倒，但继任者已经成熟。它们大多沿用「变换 + 量化 + 熵编码」框架，但用了更先进的变换、更大的块、帧内预测和现代熵编码（如 <a href=\"../entropy-coding/arithmetic-coding-ans\">ANS</a>）。下表是截至 2025 年底的格局。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>格式</th>\n<th>来源</th>\n<th>相对 JPEG</th>\n<th>浏览器支持 (2025)</th>\n<th>定位</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>WebP</td>\n<td>Google/VP8</td>\n<td>中等提升</td>\n<td>全主流</td>\n<td>过渡期通用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AVIF</td>\n<td>AV1 视频帧内</td>\n<td>显著更小</td>\n<td>约 93%（Safari 16+）</td>\n<td>网页主力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>JPEG XL</td>\n<td>JPEG 委员会</td>\n<td>高质量更优、支持无损迁移</td>\n<td>有限（争议中）</td>\n<td>专业摄影/归档</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HEIC</td>\n<td>HEVC</td>\n<td>与 AVIF 相近</td>\n<td>仅 Safari（约 18%）</td>\n<td>苹果生态</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>2025 年的实务共识是：网页图片优先 AVIF（压缩好、支持广），它对中低质量、网页用途的图片尤其出色；专业摄影、高比特深度、HDR 归档则 JPEG XL 更强，且能从已有 JPEG 无损转码省体积；HEIC 主要活在苹果设备本地。AVIF 因脱胎于 AV1 视频编码，在低码率下细节保留明显优于老格式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"音频-心理声学模型\">音频：心理声学模型</h2><p>音频有损压缩（MP3、AAC、Opus）的灵魂是心理声学模型，它编码的是「人耳能听到什么」而非「信号是什么」。它利用两类听觉现象。其一是绝对听阈与频率掩蔽：一个强音会抬高其邻近频率的听阈，使附近的弱音变得听不见，于是这些被掩蔽的成分可以丢弃或粗量化。其二是时间掩蔽：强音前后短时间内的弱音也会被掩蔽。</p>\n<p>技术上，音频编码器把信号用 MDCT（改进离散余弦变换）变到频域，再按心理声学模型计算出每个频带的「掩蔽阈值」，把量化噪声藏到阈值以下——即把比特优先分给人耳听得见的频带。Opus 在低延迟、宽码率范围上表现尤为全面，是 2026 年实时通信（WebRTC）和流媒体的主流选择，AAC 则在苹果生态和广播领域稳固。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么这些技巧对文本无效\">为什么这些技巧对文本无效</h2><p>媒体压缩的惊人比特率有个前提常被忽略：它依赖人类感知的特性。同样的招数用在文本、代码、数据库上是灾难——丢掉「不重要」的字符会改变语义。这正是<a href=\"../foundations/lossless-vs-lossy\">无损与有损分水岭</a>的实际后果：DCT、量化、心理声学只在「接收者是人的感官、且容忍误差」时才合法。当接收者是程序或必须精确时，就只能回到<a href=\"../entropy-coding/\">熵编码</a>和<a href=\"../dictionary/lz77-lz78-lzw\">字典方法</a>的无损世界。如何在具体场景里做这个判断，是<a href=\"compression-tradeoffs\">压缩选型</a>的核心议题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>媒体有损压缩攻击的是感知冗余：人眼对高频/色度迟钝，人耳听不见被掩蔽的弱音。</li>\n<li>核心套路是变换编码：变到频域 → 按感知量化（唯一的有损步）→ 系数大量归零 → <a href=\"../entropy-coding/run-length\">RLE</a> + <a href=\"../entropy-coding/arithmetic-coding-ans\">熵编码</a>。</li>\n<li>JPEG 是范本：8×8 DCT + 量化表 + 色度子采样 + Z 字形扫描，质量参数即<a href=\"../foundations/lossless-vs-lossy\">率失真</a>取舍点。</li>\n<li>2025–2026 格局：网页用 AVIF（压缩好、支持广），专业归档用 JPEG XL，HEIC 限苹果生态。</li>\n<li>音频靠心理声学模型与 MDCT，把量化噪声藏到掩蔽阈值下；Opus 是当下实时与流媒体主流。</li>\n<li>这些技巧仅在「接收者是人的感官且容忍误差」时合法，对文本/代码无效（见<a href=\"../foundations/lossless-vs-lossy\">无损与有损</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"图像与音频有损压缩","id":"图像与音频有损压缩"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：感知冗余与变换编码","id":"核心概念-感知冗余与变换编码"},{"level":2,"text":"JPEG：变换编码的经典范本","id":"jpeg-变换编码的经典范本"},{"level":2,"text":"现代图像格式：AVIF、JPEG XL 之争（2025–2026）","id":"现代图像格式-avif-jpeg-xl-之争-2025-2026"},{"level":2,"text":"音频：心理声学模型","id":"音频-心理声学模型"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么这些技巧对文本无效","id":"为什么这些技巧对文本无效"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"现代压缩器：zstd 与 brotli","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/data-compression-algorithms/dictionary/modern-compressors"},"next":{"title":"列式与数据库压缩","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/data-compression-algorithms/specialized/columnar-compression"}}